{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to plants with OAI classifications and recalls before and after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E34", "E47", "E57", "E61", "E82", "E95", "D4", "D5", "D6", "D7", "D8", "D9", "D10", "D11", "D12", "D13", "D14", "D15", "E26", "E28", "E32", "E38", "E41", "E44", "E51", "E52", "E54", "E55", "E64", "E67", "E69", "E71", "E72", "E74", "E80", "E81", "E85", "E87", "E89", "E93", "E124"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the dextrose monohydrate shortage on 2022-01-13 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21, spanning 57 months.",
      "cites": ["E124", "D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our labeled suppliers include B. Braun US Pharmaceutical Manufacturing LLC (FEI 2021236), Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEIs 1025114, 1416980, 2649614, 2618677), Bieffe Medital SA (FEI 3005164365), Hospira Inc. (FEI 1021343), and InfoRLife SA for Sandoz Inc.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E47", "E57", "E61", "E82", "E95", "E96"]
    },
    {
      "text": "B. Braun's plant received an OAI classification letter dated 2020-10-22, 448 days before the shortage posting, and a subsequent OAI inspection ended 2025-11-21.",
      "cites": ["D15", "E26", "E32", "E34"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter plants have multiple OAI inspections: FEI 1025114 with OAI inspections ending 2012-11-16, 2016-02-26, 2024-02-09, and 2024-08-01; FEI 1416980 with OAI inspections ending 2024-08-01 and 2026-04-02; FEI 2618677 with OAI inspections ending 2010-08-26, 2013-04-19, 2014-02-11, 2015-05-01, and 2016-10-03.",
      "cites": ["E38", "E41", "E44", "E52", "E54", "E64", "E67", "E69", "E71", "E72"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira's plant (FEI 1021343) had OAI inspections ending 2010-01-19, 2011-06-17, and 2011-08-04, with a VAI inspection ending 2019-11-21, 784 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E85", "E87", "E89", "E93", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Class I recall D-1257-2020 by B. Braun started 2020-04-18 (635 days before posting) and Class II recalls by Baxter and B. Braun occurred both before and after the posting, including recalls D-0076-2021 (463 days before), D-0434-2023 (412 days after), D-0543-2023 (426 days after), D-0579-2023 (481 days after), and D-1141-2023 (575 days after).",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6", "D9", "D10", "D11", "D12", "E97", "E98", "E99", "E100", "E102", "E103"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-identified best option is to buy from Civica Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and uses InfoRLife SA as its plant.",
      "cites": ["D16"]
    }
  ]
}
